  "full_text": "Got a haircut. Hey puppy. Got a haircut, yeah. So. Hey, look at this. It's a fort. What do you say? I don't know. You want to go check that shit out, right? No, no, no. I'm not a kid. I'm not a kid anymore. Look at this right here. This right here. So, uh. Wow, look at that. Diana. Diana takes photos. God said a bouncing photon was a folded coffee filter. No, no. A bouncing photon is a yarmulke. I hate when that happens. So, humility before honor. Here. So, Mr. God, the seed digs into the ground. How does the seed dig into the ground? Natural. I wonder if... I wonder if cultivated trees, if their seeds are broken, do they have to be manually shoved into the ground? God is disgusted by, God said pets are homo. He's disgusted by how tame and dependent they are. I wonder if Mr. God has the same feelings about plants. He's like, no, you fucked up my fucking plant, you nigger monkey. You fucked up my fucking plan. God damn you little nigger monkey. Dad's over there. That's why we like you private. What? Nigger monkey? You will guide me with your counsel and afterwards receive me to glory. You see, God is going to lead you with his counsel. How? Through his word. He's going to lead you and guide you.",
